WEBVTT

00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:18.875
– Stop right there!
– Please, spare my life!

00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:24.375
Damn, missed the mark.

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:26.250
Oh, what sturdy bone structure...

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:31.542
What? You mean me?

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:35.917
All alone this late at night?

00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:40.042
This ain't the Gojo Bridge, you know.
Don't you think it's a bit dangerous for you?

00:00:40.292 --> 00:00:42.917
You're the one who's in danger here.

00:02:36.042 --> 00:02:38.208
"Jakotsumaru of the Red Bone Palace"

00:02:43.917 --> 00:02:46.583
A-All good, Moroha?

00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:49.333
So this is the Feudal Era...

00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:50.417
Setsuna.

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:51.917
Setsuna!

00:02:52.042 --> 00:02:52.917
I'm glad you're safe.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.667
Yes. I have managed to return.

00:02:55.917 --> 00:03:00.375
<i>If we defeated Root Head, how are we</i>
<i>getting back to the modern era?</i>

00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:03.542
Maybe this wasn't a good idea.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.875
<i>Lady Kyuki.</i>

00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:14.875
Yotsume.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:20.000
<i>The girl who defeated Tokotsu</i>
<i>has returned to these lands.</i>

00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:25.750
So this is Moroha.
To think he was defeated by this child...

00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:27.208
Yotsume.

00:03:27.208 --> 00:03:28.958
How is Jakotsumaru doing?

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:34.208
<i>He is eagerly gathering bones </i>
<i>in order to revive his father.</i>

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.583
Then let him take his revenge.

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:39.292
Tell Jakotsumaru so, won't you?

00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:40.500
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:46.042
There we go.

00:03:46.875 --> 00:03:49.292
Okay Granny,
can you look after my stuff?

00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:52.083
Sure, that's fine, but...

00:03:52.458 --> 00:03:56.625
All right. I'm going to go sell these
to the corpse dealer.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.083
See you! I'll be back!

00:04:00.417 --> 00:04:05.167
My goodness, she's just like Kagome,
running around everywhere...

00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:13.583
Did you find anything?

00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:17.417
The Dream Butterfly, huh?
It doesn't sound like it's an apparition.

00:04:18.042 --> 00:04:20.542
Could it be like a shikigami or a puppet?

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:22.417
Perhaps.

00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:26.667
According to this,
it could be inhabiting Mount Musubi.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.750
Mount Musubi, huh?

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.250
Let's try going there, Setsuna.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.667
Chief, are there any slaying jobs available?

00:04:33.667 --> 00:04:35.792
As a matter of fact, I do!

00:04:35.792 --> 00:04:38.292
I was going to ask Hisui, but...

00:04:38.292 --> 00:04:39.667
Setsuna.

00:04:40.208 --> 00:04:44.542
I walk my own path. If you want
to hunt bugs, then do it on your own.

00:04:49.458 --> 00:04:51.417
Whoa, what is this?

00:04:51.417 --> 00:04:53.542
The bones have been pulled out.

00:04:53.917 --> 00:04:55.458
It must be an apparition.

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:57.833
This is about the tenth victim now.

00:04:57.833 --> 00:05:01.333
I heard that the demon
looks like a beautiful boy.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.333
Could we ask you demon slayers
to take care of this?

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.833
Leave it to us.

00:05:07.042 --> 00:05:08.250
Uncle,

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.000
why won't you let me handle this job?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.958
The problem is your Hiraikotsu.

00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:16.667
My older sister once went up against
a bone-eating demon.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.500
Mother did?

00:05:18.958 --> 00:05:24.542
She mentioned that Hiraikotsu is
practically food for bone-eating demons.

00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:28.292
So this apparition appears
near the river at night?

00:05:28.292 --> 00:05:29.042
Yes.

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:31.500
Fine. I will slay it.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.042
Let's do our best, Setsuna.

00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:35.583
You're going to help us?

00:05:35.583 --> 00:05:37.208
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:39.917
I'm surprised you two get along!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.542
I can't believe
you're Sesshomaru's daughters.

00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:44.542
We're complete strangers.

00:05:44.625 --> 00:05:48.083
Hey, that's not nice!
I'm doing this for you, and—

00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:49.583
Shut up.
Stop following me around.

00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:50.750
All right, all right.

00:05:51.375 --> 00:05:54.875
If you run into any trouble,
make sure to let us know, alright?

00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:57.083
That's why I'm having
Kirara tag along.

00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:00.667
Will you be fine on your own?

00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:02.792
I have Kirara.

00:06:02.917 --> 00:06:05.458
Her older sister Towa
will be with her, too.

00:06:06.417 --> 00:06:08.250
I'm counting on you, Kirara.

00:06:10.042 --> 00:06:13.458
– Whoa, Kirara, you're awesome!
– Let's go.

00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:15.667
Don't touch me.
Don't grab on to me.

00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:18.250
But then I'd fall off!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.000
How's that, Corpse Dealer Jyubei?

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.042
I had a pretty hard time with this one!

00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:28.958
Where had you vanished to

00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:31.083
these past few days, Moroha?

00:06:31.167 --> 00:06:32.917
Planning on turning tail, eh?

00:06:33.792 --> 00:06:34.958
Of course not!

00:06:34.958 --> 00:06:39.958
Remember, you're on a short leash.
You still have a debt to pay.

00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:42.417
No need to remind me!
I'll pay it back soon.

00:06:42.958 --> 00:06:47.458
Don't forget your promise.
I'm the one shouldering your debt.

00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:48.958
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:52.958
The Hitokon and the flea demon.
That'll be six mon.

00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:57.208
Six mon?! That's the toll to
cross the Sanzu River!

00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:58.625
Wait. Flea demon?

00:07:01.292 --> 00:07:03.417
Long time no see, Lady Moroha!

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:08.542
But how could you be so horrible
as to sell me off?!

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:11.458
Didn't see you there,
Grandpa Myoga.

00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:17.167
Wait, you weren't selling that?
Five mon, then.

00:07:17.167 --> 00:07:19.375
Oh, come on.

00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:23.417
When I brought you Tokotsu,
you gave me a bag of silver!

00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:26.833
Right, that headless Tokotsu.

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:29.500
This and that are a world of difference.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:34.167
If you also had Tokotsu's head,
I would've given you a bag of gold.

00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:38.042
Besides, that bag of silver
was actually a deposit.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.625
What? Really?

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:44.333
If you don't bring me the head,
I'll have you pay back the deposit.

00:07:44.542 --> 00:07:45.833
Takechiyo, are you here?

00:07:48.375 --> 00:07:49.875
What is it, Master Jyubei?

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.375
I can't let Moroha escape.

00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:56.375
Follow her around
and make sure she slays Tokotsu.

00:07:56.458 --> 00:07:57.542
You got it!

00:07:57.875 --> 00:08:04.333
I'm sure Jakotsumaru has been gathering bones
in order to revive his father.

00:08:04.792 --> 00:08:10.000
You need to slay him before that happens,
or you'll have trouble on your hands.

00:08:12.167 --> 00:08:14.750
So, would you happen to
know where he is?

00:08:15.042 --> 00:08:16.750
I'll take you there.

00:08:17.042 --> 00:08:18.542
You better be thankful.

00:08:19.042 --> 00:08:20.208
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:34.792 --> 00:08:35.708
Getting bored?

00:08:35.917 --> 00:08:38.625
No, not at all.
I just got a little sleepy.

00:08:38.625 --> 00:08:39.542
Sleepy?

00:08:39.542 --> 00:08:42.750
Oh, uh, that's not what I meant, um...

00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:44.417
Sorry, Setsuna.

00:08:44.417 --> 00:08:46.917
Stop apologizing all the time.
It's annoying.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.833
By the way, I've never seen
the sky so dark at night—

00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:52.042
Be quiet!

00:09:33.167 --> 00:09:34.750
Scourge of Swallows!

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.792
Did we get him?

00:09:50.792 --> 00:09:52.542
No, he escaped.

00:09:52.542 --> 00:09:56.708
That's a relief.
I didn't want to kill such a cute child.

00:09:56.708 --> 00:09:58.958
Are you still saying such things?

00:09:59.708 --> 00:10:01.000
Is this...

00:10:02.417 --> 00:10:04.625
The shards of bones keep going.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.958
He's at the end of this trail.

00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:19.500
All right, Takechiyo. I'll be done soon,
so wait around in a safe spot.

00:10:20.042 --> 00:10:22.167
Don't you dare run away, Moroha.

00:10:22.167 --> 00:10:25.417
I'll be watching you.

00:10:32.333 --> 00:10:33.708
Moroha.

00:10:33.917 --> 00:10:37.167
Is that you, Towa?
And Setsuna, too!

00:10:37.875 --> 00:10:41.833
Are you both here to swipe
my bounty again?

00:10:42.375 --> 00:10:44.500
Moroha, your prey is here as well?

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:48.792
I'm not telling you!
This one's worth a bag of gold.

00:10:48.792 --> 00:10:50.167
A bag of gold?

00:10:52.625 --> 00:10:53.917
Lady Moroha!

00:10:53.917 --> 00:10:58.542
As one of the Four Perils, Tokotsu's head is
worth more than a bag of gold!

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:00.958
He's worth at least a gold ingot.

00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:03.000
– Will you shut up?
– Oh, scary!

00:11:03.375 --> 00:11:08.667
The problem is the remaining Four Perils.
They won't be silent for long.

00:11:09.333 --> 00:11:10.875
That's true.

00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:14.167
<i>But if I get them involved,</i>
<i>things might work out!</i>

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.417
<i>Moroha is scheming something.</i>

00:11:21.458 --> 00:11:26.125
There be my father's murderer—
Moroha the Demon Killer!

00:11:27.375 --> 00:11:31.083
Starting from my Master,
the Great Dog-Demon himself,

00:11:31.167 --> 00:11:35.292
I've been serving this family
for three generations. My name is Myoga.

00:11:35.292 --> 00:11:41.125
And I must say, Lady Moroha's blood is
closest to the Great Dog-Demon's...

00:11:41.125 --> 00:11:44.625
even more delicious than
Master Inuyasha's!

00:11:44.625 --> 00:11:49.042
I don't care about all that.
Just tell me about the Four Perils.

00:11:49.292 --> 00:11:52.625
The Four Perils were demons
that crossed over from the mainland

00:11:52.625 --> 00:11:54.792
during the Spring and Autumn Period.

00:11:54.792 --> 00:12:00.917
They are demon beasts named
Konton, Totetsu, Kyuki, and Tokotsu.

00:12:01.292 --> 00:12:07.917
They were controlled by Kirinmaru,
a Beast King like the Great Dog-Demon.

00:12:08.417 --> 00:12:11.083
Kirinmaru? Did you just say Kirinmaru?

00:12:11.375 --> 00:12:15.250
Yes, I did. What about him?

00:12:15.458 --> 00:12:18.458
We heard that Kirinmaru is
attempting to distort time

00:12:18.458 --> 00:12:21.458
and swallow this world
into a degenerate age.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:26.250
I find it hard to believe
that such a resplendent Beast King

00:12:26.375 --> 00:12:28.500
would hold such ambitions.

00:12:29.917 --> 00:12:34.583
Father, please wake up.
Please, my dear gracious father.

00:12:36.292 --> 00:12:40.458
Lord Tokotsu,
it is the time of your awakening.

00:12:43.333 --> 00:12:48.458
But I sure didn't know
that Tokotsu was Kirinmaru's underling.

00:12:49.208 --> 00:12:50.083
Now what?

00:12:50.167 --> 00:12:52.250
You're planning to
rope us into this!

00:12:52.667 --> 00:12:56.750
In return, I'll help you
look for the Dream Butterfly.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.250
Hmph, not even worth it.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.292
Moroha, you're really strong, huh?

00:13:01.292 --> 00:13:03.375
Was the Four Perils demon just too weak?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:08.375
Well, the thing is,
I don't remember slaying it!

00:13:08.833 --> 00:13:10.375
You don't remember?

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:15.375
I don't have any memory
of what happened during the fight.

00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:20.375
All I remember is that I took
his Red Rainbow Pearl.

00:13:20.625 --> 00:13:24.500
And when I was carrying his corpse,
his underlings chased after me

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.167
so I ran as fast as I could!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:31.500
I didn't know he was worth a bag of silver
or that his name was Tokotsu

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.750
until the Corpse Dealer Jyubei told me so.

00:13:38.042 --> 00:13:41.708
All that luck fell right into
your lap, huh...

00:13:42.042 --> 00:13:43.333
That's one way to put it.

00:13:43.792 --> 00:13:46.833
That means someone else
killed Tokotsu, then.

00:13:47.292 --> 00:13:49.792
Right? Talk about false accusation.

00:13:49.792 --> 00:13:51.250
And that's not all.

00:13:51.542 --> 00:13:54.542
As things are, we'll be following
the Tree of Age's request.

00:13:54.542 --> 00:13:55.750
Oh, no.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.833
If we defeat the Four Perils,
then Kirinmaru will emerge.

00:13:59.042 --> 00:14:01.708
If Kirinmaru emerges, then...

00:14:02.042 --> 00:14:05.917
Sesshomaru.
We'll have to fight our own father.

00:14:06.292 --> 00:14:10.708
What?! Then these two
are Sesshomaru's daughters?

00:14:10.708 --> 00:14:12.042
Seems like it.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.750
So what will you do?

00:14:16.833 --> 00:14:20.875
On the other side is Kirinmaru's underling,
one of the Four Perils.

00:14:20.875 --> 00:14:23.458
The bounty is one gold ingot.

00:14:23.458 --> 00:14:26.333
Come on, let's split
the bounty three ways!

00:14:26.333 --> 00:14:29.583
We're buddies who traveled together
to the modern era.

00:14:29.583 --> 00:14:32.792
From here on,
we can help each other out.

00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:39.708
Welcome. My father Tokotsu
has been patiently waiting as well.

00:14:40.125 --> 00:14:42.500
Both of you, don't let your guard down.

00:14:42.625 --> 00:14:45.083
You're the one
who should be on guard.

00:14:45.167 --> 00:14:48.875
He thinks you're the one
who killed his father.

00:14:48.875 --> 00:14:50.083
Oh, right.

00:14:50.667 --> 00:14:55.417
If you explain how you got the bounty
on pure luck, I'm sure he'll understand.

00:14:55.417 --> 00:14:58.083
We can say that we'll even
return the money...

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.917
Don't be stupid!

00:14:59.917 --> 00:15:04.625
If a bounty hunter returns her bounty,
she isn't a bounty hunter anymore!

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:12.833
If you're out for vengeance,
then I just have to strike back.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.167
You'll strike back?

00:15:23.167 --> 00:15:25.458
I haven't even died yet.

00:15:25.625 --> 00:15:26.833
Father.

00:15:26.917 --> 00:15:32.125
I cannot forgive you for stealing my
treasured Red Rainbow Pearl,

00:15:32.125 --> 00:15:35.667
but it's outrageous
that you would sell off my body!

00:15:35.667 --> 00:15:37.667
I won't forgive you, you wretch.

00:15:37.833 --> 00:15:42.458
Stop it, you're making me sound
like a bad person!

00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:44.250
But she <i>is </i>the bad person.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.583
Indeed.

00:15:45.792 --> 00:15:48.000
I'll take back my Red Rainbow Pearl,

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.958
and separate your head
from your body like you did mine.

00:15:54.917 --> 00:15:56.708
You're getting shabby, Tokotsu.

00:15:56.708 --> 00:16:00.250
You can't be a member of the
Four Perils with just your skull.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.500
Karma sucks, huh!
So give up already—

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:07.333
No, Moroha. You have to apologize.
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:11.958
Too naïve. Does your world
forgive anyone who apologizes?

00:16:12.333 --> 00:16:15.875
Rubbish! If apologies solved everything,
we wouldn't need a magistrate!

00:16:15.875 --> 00:16:19.875
I'm not apologizing.
Bounty hunting is my job.

00:16:20.208 --> 00:16:23.042
I'll just have to power my way through!

00:16:23.292 --> 00:16:25.333
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.250
Father!

00:16:29.417 --> 00:16:33.750
So you'll pave your path.
I expect nothing less from my friend!

00:16:34.583 --> 00:16:36.292
Cyclone Burst!

00:16:40.875 --> 00:16:42.042
<i>Setsuna.</i>

00:16:44.625 --> 00:16:48.833
<i>Too naïve. Does your worl</i>d<i>
forgive anyone who apologizes</i>?

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:53.083
<i>You're right.</i>
<i>Everything can't be resolved with apologies.</i>

00:16:54.958 --> 00:16:56.542
Setsuna, Moroha.

00:16:56.917 --> 00:16:59.000
I'll join you!

00:17:00.083 --> 00:17:03.500
Right. If I'm dealing with skeletons,
I don't have to hesitate.

00:17:03.583 --> 00:17:05.333
Because they're already dead.

00:17:08.125 --> 00:17:10.792
I'll rip your bones out!

00:17:15.083 --> 00:17:15.958
Wh-What?

00:17:17.167 --> 00:17:19.458
I had purification salt in my mouth.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.250
Damn you. Why?

00:17:21.833 --> 00:17:25.125
Why does a demon like you
possess spirit powers?

00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:28.375
I can explain that part.

00:17:28.375 --> 00:17:30.542
What? Who was that?
Where are you?

00:17:30.542 --> 00:17:32.750
I'm right here! Hup...

00:17:33.417 --> 00:17:34.750
Grandpa Myoga.

00:17:35.583 --> 00:17:39.500
Lady Moroha is the daughter of Kagome,

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:44.000
the reincarnation of the
legendary priestess Kikyo.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.792
Of course she would
possess spirit powers!

00:17:46.917 --> 00:17:50.292
What? The daughter
of Kikyo's reincarnation?

00:17:50.667 --> 00:17:53.167
Doesn't that make this mostly unrelated?

00:17:53.417 --> 00:17:54.500
You be quiet!

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:57.875
Grandpa Myoga, I'm surprised
you haven't run away yet.

00:17:58.625 --> 00:18:01.542
Well, I think that'll be
happening very soon.

00:18:01.542 --> 00:18:05.000
Yes. That's right. Soon.

00:18:06.625 --> 00:18:10.292
I'll be able to taste my Master's blood
for the first time in 200 years!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:14.542
Aw man, but if I do this...

00:18:14.792 --> 00:18:15.750
Oh, right.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:17.042
Towa, Setsuna.

00:18:17.042 --> 00:18:20.500
I'll be out for a whole day after this,
so I'm counting on you!

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.708
What? What do you mean?

00:18:22.875 --> 00:18:24.292
You're such a handful.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.167
With this rouge,

00:18:31.792 --> 00:18:34.792
I become Beniyasha, Destroyer of Lands.

00:18:35.208 --> 00:18:40.167
Tremble before the bloodthirsty dawn!
Bear witness to your end, if you so dare!

00:18:40.458 --> 00:18:45.042
This rouge was a gift from the
Great Dog-Demon to his wife, Lady Izayoi.

00:18:45.042 --> 00:18:50.708
When Lady Moroha applies the rouge,
his memories are revived in her blood!

00:18:50.708 --> 00:18:52.792
It's the best! It can't be beat!

00:18:52.792 --> 00:18:56.167
Thank you for the meal!
This flea is thrilled!

00:18:58.625 --> 00:18:59.542
Wha...

00:18:59.542 --> 00:19:02.083
Jakotsumaru, do not let your guard down.

00:19:02.083 --> 00:19:06.125
My body was separated from me
by those devilish claws.

00:19:06.125 --> 00:19:07.958
How dare you!
I won't forgive you!

00:19:14.583 --> 00:19:16.542
Iron-Reaver, Soul-Stealer!

00:19:23.958 --> 00:19:26.792
Aw, poor fellow.

00:19:27.167 --> 00:19:30.625
How dare you kill Jakotsumaru!

00:19:35.625 --> 00:19:37.208
Blades of Blood!

00:19:43.292 --> 00:19:44.958
Moroha, you're amazing!

00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:47.208
No, it's not really that great.

00:19:49.292 --> 00:19:51.208
She's used up her demon energy.

00:19:51.708 --> 00:19:54.375
So she lasts about a minute, huh?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.958
I can't even make
a cup of noodles in that time.

00:19:56.958 --> 00:19:58.917
Curse you...

00:19:59.417 --> 00:20:01.167
It's still alive.

00:20:01.667 --> 00:20:05.500
You're a million years too early
to leave the clean up to me.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:07.125
Scourge of Swallows!

00:20:16.458 --> 00:20:20.708
Is it really okay to slay him?
We were the ones in the wrong.

00:20:20.708 --> 00:20:26.125
Towa. If you hesitate,
those boneless corpses will only increase.

00:20:26.125 --> 00:20:30.458
I see. If you think about it,
they're far worse than we are.

00:20:30.458 --> 00:20:31.375
Right, then.

00:20:31.667 --> 00:20:33.958
Tokotsu. Don't think ill of us.

00:20:34.667 --> 00:20:38.708
On meeting an arhat, slay the arhat;
on meeting your parents, slay your parents.

00:20:40.167 --> 00:20:43.208
Know that the light to your path lies there.

00:20:44.083 --> 00:20:46.500
Villain Tokotsu, of the Four Perils.

00:20:47.208 --> 00:20:48.458
Rest in peace!

00:21:08.667 --> 00:21:13.792
Lord Jyubei, they demolished everything
including the Red Bone Palace!

00:21:14.042 --> 00:21:16.417
<i>Even Tokotsu and Jakotsumaru?</i>

00:21:16.417 --> 00:21:18.792
Yes. Without a single trace.

00:21:19.042 --> 00:21:21.125
<i>Wonderful, Half-Demon Princesses.</i>

00:21:21.125 --> 00:21:25.125
<i>However, no remains means</i>
<i> I can't give a bounty.</i>

00:21:25.125 --> 00:21:27.542
Which means the profits go to us!

00:21:27.542 --> 00:21:29.125
<i>Exactly.</i>

00:21:29.958 --> 00:21:30.708
<i>Come on back.</i>

00:21:30.708 --> 00:21:31.917
Yes, sir!

00:21:40.333 --> 00:21:43.000
Setsuna, what were you whispering earlier?

00:21:43.833 --> 00:21:46.875
Something I heard from a
traveling monk a long time ago.

00:21:48.958 --> 00:21:50.708
It just crossed my mind.

00:21:52.708 --> 00:21:54.000
There's nothing left.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.000
Looks like we can't get a bounty, huh?

00:21:57.417 --> 00:21:58.542
Most likely.

00:22:01.208 --> 00:22:04.375
<i>A quarter-demon with both </i>
<i>spirit power and demon power...</i>

00:22:05.708 --> 00:22:07.333
<i>How interesting.</i>

00:23:43.875 --> 00:23:49.042
The Corpse Dealer Jyubei entrusts us
with a case of missing travelers.

00:23:49.042 --> 00:23:51.708
What we find is a
mysterious village full of cats.

00:23:51.708 --> 00:23:53.667
The entire village smells like demon.

00:23:53.667 --> 00:23:56.750
At the old temple in
this ghost cat–infested village

00:23:56.750 --> 00:24:01.292
lives a man who looks exactly like Julian,
Mei's favorite idol.

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.708
Do you have business at this temple?

00:24:03.833 --> 00:24:06.083
My name is Juan.

00:24:06.083 --> 00:24:09.208
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:</i>
"The Cat Juan at the Old Temple"

00:24:09.208 --> 00:24:23.894
Can we really make money from this?
